{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233810","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233810","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423381001:1":{"text":"音楽、美術、読書……子どもたちの興味もそれぞれ違うから。","source_cn":"音乐，美术，阅读……每个孩子的兴趣都不太一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA7A72BA4FBE37B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423381002:1":{"text":"でも、体育だけは全員大好きなのよね。","source_cn":"不过大家都不讨厌的就是体育课吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x116BC72DAF8B8B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423381003:1":{"text":"やっぱり、子どもの頃から外で駆け回っていたからかしら。駆けっこだと全然追いつけないのよ……","source_cn":"毕竟是在从小生活的山野里奔跑，他们每次都能把我远远甩在后面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x631440386F3488D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423381004:1":{"text":"自分用に、体力作りのメニューを組むべきかしら……","source_cn":"我在想，我是不是也要加强体能训练了呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4295623074D4F987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"オーロナ","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}